COMMENT     The assembly wtCirTent3.hap1.1 is based on 29x PacBio data and
            Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project
            (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included
            the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation
            with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based
            scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using
            OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually
            improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the
            Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and
            orientation of the contigs on chromosome 1 (14,993 - 15,964 &
            19,047 - 19,279 Kbp) are unknown.  The exact order and orientation
            of the contigs on chromosome 14 (23,252 - 23,671 Kbp) are unknown.
            The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 15
            (23,555 - 23,902 - 25,265 - 25,720 gghKbp) are unknown.
